    "provider": "ICAS",
    "q": "<p>A plc (A) acquired 90% of an American subsidiary, X Inc (X), on 1 January 20X2. Abbreviated statements of financial position of X Inc are as follows:</p><p>Statements of financial position (abbreviated)</p><p>As at</p><p>1 January 20X2</p><p>31 December 20X2</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">$’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">$’000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Net assets</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\">14,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">6,000</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\">14,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The relevant exchange rates are as follows:</p><p>1 January 20X2 – $1.60: £1</p><p>Average for 20X2 – $1.59: £1</p><p>31 December 20X2 – $1.55: £1</p><p>No goodwill arose on the acquisition. X did not pay a dividend during the year.</p><p>The exchange gains/losses on translation are:</p><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><div><span>Exchange gain on translation equal to £267,000</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><div><span>Exchange loss on translation equal to £267,000</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><div><span>Exchange gain on translation equal to £81,000</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><div><span>Exchange loss on translation equal to £81,000</span></div></div><p>Construct, showing all workings, the abbreviated statement of financial position as at 31 December 20X2 in presentation currency.</p>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is a.</p><p>Retained profit for the year = $10,000 - $6,000 = $4,000</p><p>Opening net assets</p><p>Closing rate</p><p>Opening rate</p><p>Exchange difference</p><p>£’000</p><p>£’000</p><p>£’000</p><p>Share capital</p><p>$4,000/1.55</p><p>$4,000/1.60</p><p>2,581</p><p>2,500</p><p>81</p><p>Retained earnings</p><p>$6,000/1.55</p><p>$6,000/1.60</p><p>3,871</p><p>3,750</p><p>121</p><p>Profits</p><p>Closing rate</p><p>Average rate</p><p>Retained profit for the year</p><p>$4,000/1.55</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>$4,000/1.59</td><td class=\"num\">2,581</td><td class=\"num\">2,516</td><td class=\"num\">65</td></tr><tr><td>Exchange gains on translation</td><td class=\"num\">267</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">81</td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">186</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Translation reserve</td><td class=\"num\">267</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Being exchange gains on translation of subsidiary in the current year</p><p>Solution</p><p>Draft</p><p>Draft</p><p>Dr</p><p>Cr</p><p>Adjusted</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">$’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Net assets</td><td class=\"num\">14,000</td><td class=\"num\">9,033</td><td class=\"num\">9,033</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\">2,581</td><td class=\"num\">81</td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\">6,452</td><td class=\"num\">186</td><td class=\"num\">6,266</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Translation reserve</td><td class=\"num\">267</td><td class=\"num\">267</td><td class=\"num\">14,000</td><td class=\"num\">9,033</td><td class=\"num\">9,033</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Note: Share capital is stated at £2,500 ($4,000/1.60), which is at the spot rate on the date of acquisition.</p><p>Retained earnings consist of:</p><p>Pre-acquisition retained earnings of £3,750 ($6,000/1.60), which are at the spot rate on the date of acquisition, and</p><p>Post-acquisition profits of £2,516 ($4,000/1.59), which are stated at the average rate for the year</p><p>This ensures that when we start consolidation procedures, we can eliminate X’s share capital and pre-acquisition reserves.</p>",
